    "UIName": "Gatekeeper 'DeVega'",
    "Id": "mechdef_gatekeeper_GKP-DVG",
    "Name": "Gatekeeper GKP-DVG",
    "Details": "The origins of the warrior known as DeVega are obscured by contradictory records and suspiciously missing files. Rumor claims he was once a high-ranking Clan Wolf warrior before defecting to ComStar, but records show he was born in Canopus space. Whatever the truth, his extraordinary kill count and reputation for ruthless efficiency made him an obvious candidate for Society recruitment. His customized Gatekeeper reflects that reputation. Twin Society Light Ultra Gauss Rifles and paired iATM-12 launchers provide precise, adaptable firepower at nearly any range, while jump jets allow the massive OmniMech to rapidly reposition and exploit unexpected firing angles. Where DeVega's loyalties truly lie remains uncertain. The Society seems content not to ask. His targets disappear all the same.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.21</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Gatekeeper"
  },
